From c787920f83f79ff6652cb00c1b74f991ddee0392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:51:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test: step-aware mask pins and unrolled-differential flip

StructuralTest: step-aware masks over the statement's own scan axis accepted (maskOwnAxisAfterScan,
maskInterScanAxis, maskStepScanAxis, new maskStepScanAndOutput); base/contracted/unbound refusals kept.
ScanCompileTest: seededAxisZero restated to [1,3,0.25,0.75,0,0]; plan-level maskContextRank pins
(mismatch in a block and at top level, live-ctx block run f64 + f32, base-at-1 refused).
NonlinCompileTest: four source programs checked vs reference (per-step intermediate, step statement,
slot-cache causal and sliding-window attention), values from expected_step_mask.py.
ScanUnroll: maskSubst reads the live step literal in a recurrence body; DifferentialTest T5.4
restated and the step program run three-way. ScanAffineEmitTest: JAX refuses axiswiseContextMask.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
